WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.033
-The House Ethics Committee

00:00:03.033 --> 00:00:04.434
has opened an investigation

00:00:04.434 --> 00:00:06.334
into Florida
Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:08.767
and now Gaetz
has reportedly been snubbed

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:11.300
by his political idol,
former President Donald Trump.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.400
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.367
♪♪

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:19.400
Without Donald Trump
as their standard bearer

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.567
and with Joe Biden
getting high marks in polls

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:24.000
on everything from the economy
to his infrastructure bill,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.367
to his COVID response,

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.534
we're starting to get a picture
of what, if anything,

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:29.100
the post-Trump GOP stands for --

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.100
from the Arkansas
state legislature

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:32.667
passing a cruel and horrific law

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:34.868
banning gender-affirming
medical care

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:38.367
to Georgia, Texas, and several
other GOP-controlled states

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.634
passing Draconian new
voter suppression laws,

00:00:40.634 --> 00:00:42.667
based on the lie
that the 2020 election

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:44.300
was somehow stolen from Trump.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:47.868
And, by the way, just as a side
note to conservative pundits,

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:51.300
it's not like a gotcha
to point out that you need ID

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:53.667
to fly on an airplane
or pick up your tickets

00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:55.934
from a will call booth
at a baseball game,

00:00:55.934 --> 00:00:58.901
since those are not
constitutional rights.

00:00:58.901 --> 00:01:00.367
There's no
Twenty-eighth Amendment

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.934
guaranteeing the right to pee
in a trough at a Mets game

00:01:02.934 --> 00:01:05.467
next to a guy bragging
how he once met Wally Backman

00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:07.100
at a Denny's in Las Vegas.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.467
[ New York accent ]
Refused to take
a picture with me.

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.801
Told me to go to hell.
Threw a plate of waffles at me.

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:14.300
That's the kind of attitude
we need on this team right now!

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:16.400
Get some run support for deGrom!

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:18.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:18.767 --> 00:01:20.801
Turns out that wasn't
a COVID issue.

00:01:20.801 --> 00:01:22.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:23.400
These voter suppression laws

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:24.801
have been motivated by the lie

00:01:24.801 --> 00:01:27.367
that there was widespread fraud
in the 2020 election,

00:01:27.367 --> 00:01:28.767
which there was not.

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:30.834
One of the biggest
purveyors of that lie

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:32.734
has been Florida
Congressman Matt Gaetz.

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:36.367
You know, the guy who looks like
he was drawn by Picasso.

00:01:36.367 --> 00:01:38.467
I mean, it'd be impossible
to even draw

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:40.267
a political cartoon
about Matt Gaetz

00:01:40.267 --> 00:01:43.801
because Matt Gaetz already looks
like a political cartoon.

00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:47.100
"I don't know. I guess I'll make
his head look, uh, smaller?"

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:48.434
I mean, look at that thing.

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.868
Based on that noggin,
you'd expect his mouth to move

00:01:50.868 --> 00:01:52.267
like a "South Park" character.

00:01:52.267 --> 00:01:53.334
-Oh, hamburgers!

00:01:53.334 --> 00:01:55.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.367 --> 00:01:56.467
-By the way,
he'd be a good substitutive

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:58.634
if Mr. Met ever calls in sick.

00:01:58.634 --> 00:02:00.834
Gaetz repeatedly
claimed there was fraud,

00:02:00.834 --> 00:02:02.501
even after admitting
he didn't have any proof

00:02:02.501 --> 00:02:05.667
and that the Trump campaign
couldn't produce any proof.

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.033
-I think the Department
of Justice has

00:02:07.033 --> 00:02:10.300
a lot of egg on their face
for having not discovered

00:02:10.300 --> 00:02:12.801
a lot of this fraud
as it was occurring.

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:15.701
David, as you know,
this is very hard to find,

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:18.567
prove, and obtain relief on
after the fact

00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:21.167
because so many of the
ballots get commingled.

00:02:21.167 --> 00:02:22.601
-So, according to Gaetz,
the fact that

00:02:22.601 --> 00:02:24.834
you can't prove there was fraud
proves there was fraud.

00:02:24.834 --> 00:02:26.701
That's the same argument
your college roommate made

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:28.534
to prove aliens
built the pyramids.

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:30.901
[ Stoner voice ]
If aliens are advanced enough
to build pyramids

00:02:30.901 --> 00:02:32.968
then they'd also be
advanced enough to make sure

00:02:32.968 --> 00:02:35.200
they don't leave any proof
that they built the pyramids.

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:38.000
So, if there's no proof
aliens built the pyramids,

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.033
then that means aliens
built the pyramids.

00:02:40.033 --> 00:02:45.534
Krrkkhh!

00:02:45.534 --> 00:02:48.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:50.267
Or not.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.267 --> 00:02:52.801
Gaetz has been
on the vanguard of Trumpism.

00:02:52.801 --> 00:02:55.834
He's been one of the former
president's most loyal defenders

00:02:55.834 --> 00:02:57.334
and one of the strongest
advocates

00:02:57.334 --> 00:03:00.100
of turning the GOP
into a megaphone for Trumpism

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:01.701
by embracing,
among other things,

00:03:01.701 --> 00:03:03.234
wild conspiracy theories

00:03:03.234 --> 00:03:05.634
about everything
from the election to COVID,

00:03:05.634 --> 00:03:07.234
to the January 6th insurrection.

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:09.334
For example, you might remember
that, on that day,

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:11.968
as soon as members returned
to the House floor,

00:03:11.968 --> 00:03:13.701
Gaetz cited a debunked rumor

00:03:13.701 --> 00:03:17.267
that the mob was actually full
of antifa activists.

00:03:17.267 --> 00:03:19.868
-The Washington Times
has just reported

00:03:19.868 --> 00:03:21.300
some pretty compelling evidence

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:23.634
from a facial
recognition company,

00:03:23.634 --> 00:03:26.701
showing that some of the people
who breached the Capitol today

00:03:26.701 --> 00:03:28.501
were not Trump supporters.

00:03:28.501 --> 00:03:30.567
They were masquerading
as Trump supporters

00:03:30.567 --> 00:03:32.400
-[ Shouting ]
-and, in fact, were members

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:35.601
of the violent
terrorist group antifa.

00:03:35.601 --> 00:03:37.234
-Alright, first of all,
you'd think Matt Gaetz,

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:38.634
of all people,
would learn not to trust

00:03:38.634 --> 00:03:40.067
facial recognition software,

00:03:40.067 --> 00:03:42.334
since it would probably
recognize his face

00:03:42.334 --> 00:03:44.133
as a Terry Gilliam animation

00:03:44.133 --> 00:03:45.968
or a brick
with a face drawn on it.

00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:47.367
Matt Gaetz shouldn't be
in Congress.

00:03:47.367 --> 00:03:50.434
He should be in the waiting room
from "Beetlejuice."

00:03:50.434 --> 00:03:52.601
If you ran Gaetz through facial
recognition software,

00:03:52.601 --> 00:03:54.100
the computer would
probably think it was

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.234
a Tom Cruise Pez dispenser.

00:03:55.234 --> 00:03:56.334
He's got a weird head, you guys.

00:03:56.334 --> 00:03:57.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.934 --> 00:04:01.167
Gaetz was such an avid defender
of the former president,

00:04:01.167 --> 00:04:02.701
Gaetz even said
he'd quit his job

00:04:02.701 --> 00:04:04.234
to go defend Trump
in the Senate.

00:04:04.234 --> 00:04:06.567
-Would you resign,
in order to defend the president

00:04:06.567 --> 00:04:08.000
the way that you want
to defend him?

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:09.501
-I love my district.

00:04:09.501 --> 00:04:11.167
I love representing them.

00:04:11.167 --> 00:04:15.634
But I view this cancelation
of the Trump presidency

00:04:15.634 --> 00:04:20.400
and the Trump movement as one
of the major risks to my people,

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.567
both in my district and all
throughout this great country.

00:04:23.567 --> 00:04:24.567
Absolutely.

00:04:24.567 --> 00:04:26.067
If the president called me

00:04:26.067 --> 00:04:28.667
and wanted me to go defend him
on the floor of the Senate,

00:04:28.667 --> 00:04:30.901
that would be the top
priority in my life.

00:04:30.901 --> 00:04:32.701
I would leave my House seat.

00:04:32.701 --> 00:04:33.834
I would leave my home.

00:04:33.834 --> 00:04:35.934
I would do anything I had to do.

00:04:35.934 --> 00:04:38.200
-Captures the state of the
modern GOP so perfectly

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:40.567
that Gaetz thinks the best way
to defend his party is

00:04:40.567 --> 00:04:42.400
to stop being a congressman

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.968
and just join
Trump's legal team --

00:04:43.968 --> 00:04:45.801
a pillow, turtleneck,
and Giuliani.

00:04:45.801 --> 00:04:47.634
[ As Gaetz ]
If I could, I would deliver

00:04:47.634 --> 00:04:49.100
a way too loud speech

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.400
filled with misinformation
and poor syntax,

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:53.501
but, alas, me only congressman.

00:04:53.501 --> 00:04:56.033
And why leave your home?

00:04:56.033 --> 00:04:57.334
[ As Gaetz ]
I'd leave my job, my home.

00:04:57.334 --> 00:04:59.033
I'd shed my clothes
and roam the forest,

00:04:59.033 --> 00:05:02.100
subsisting on grubs and berries,
navigated by starlight,

00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:03.501
until I reached the floor
of the Senate,

00:05:03.501 --> 00:05:04.801
and then, I would
defend the president

00:05:04.801 --> 00:05:07.834
with a series of grunts
and chest thumps.

00:05:07.834 --> 00:05:10.567
I mean, you'd really do all that
to defend Donald Trump?

00:05:10.567 --> 00:05:12.567
I mean, how can
I get loyalty like that?

00:05:12.567 --> 00:05:13.834
I once got accused of stealing

00:05:13.834 --> 00:05:15.367
a muffin from the
NBC commissary

00:05:15.367 --> 00:05:16.901
and, when I asked Wally
to vouch for me,

00:05:16.901 --> 00:05:19.267
he said, "I've never seen
that man before."

00:05:19.267 --> 00:05:20.367
-You were wearing a mask!

00:05:20.367 --> 00:05:22.133
-It's been over a year!

00:05:22.133 --> 00:05:24.501
Learn what the top half
of my face looks like.

00:05:24.501 --> 00:05:25.734
-Uh.

00:05:25.734 --> 00:05:33.300
-[ Mumbles mockingly ]
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:35.734
That's how --
[ Mutters ]

00:05:35.734 --> 00:05:38.167
[ Laughter ]

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:40.200
That's how devoted Gaetz
has been,

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:42.801
not just to Trumpism,
as an ideological project,

00:05:42.801 --> 00:05:45.300
but to the man himself
and, now that Gaetz is facing

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.267
a federal investigation
and House ethics probe

00:05:47.267 --> 00:05:48.667
into, among other things,

00:05:48.667 --> 00:05:50.734
alleged sex trafficking
with his...

00:05:54.968 --> 00:05:57.501
...Gaetz has been snubbed
by his political idol.

00:05:57.501 --> 00:06:00.501
-The House Ethics Committee
has just announced

00:06:00.501 --> 00:06:02.234
it's launching
a formal investigation

00:06:02.234 --> 00:06:03.400
into the embattled

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.834
Florida Republican
Congressman Matt Gaetz.

00:06:05.834 --> 00:06:07.968
-The accusations
are stacking up.

00:06:07.968 --> 00:06:09.701
The Daily Beast now reporting

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:14.601
that Gaetz sent two late night
Venmo transactions in May 2018

00:06:14.601 --> 00:06:18.000
for $900 to his friend
Joel Greenberg,

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.000
a former Seminole County,
Florida, tax collector

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.501
and accused sex offender.

00:06:22.501 --> 00:06:23.701
-Sources tell CNN

00:06:23.701 --> 00:06:26.167
that embattled Republican
Congressman Matt Gaetz

00:06:26.167 --> 00:06:27.801
was recently denied a meeting

00:06:27.801 --> 00:06:29.901
with former President Trump
at Mar-a-Lago.

00:06:29.901 --> 00:06:32.868
Aides reportedly told Mr. Trump
not to publicly

00:06:32.868 --> 00:06:35.367
"stick his neck out"
to defend Gaetz,

00:06:35.367 --> 00:06:36.834
who is being investigated now

00:06:36.834 --> 00:06:39.467
by the Department of Justice
for sex trafficking.

00:06:39.467 --> 00:06:41.200
-Well, in fairness,
I'm not sure Trump

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.634
has a neck to stick out.

00:06:42.634 --> 00:06:44.734
His head is more
like a third shoulder.

00:06:44.734 --> 00:06:46.033
There's a good chance that,
during one

00:06:46.033 --> 00:06:47.968
of his helicopter-adjacent
press conferences,

00:06:47.968 --> 00:06:49.734
the propeller lopped
his head off

00:06:49.734 --> 00:06:51.501
and they had to sew it back
onto his torso

00:06:51.501 --> 00:06:53.501
on the taxpayer's dime!

00:06:53.501 --> 00:06:54.767
[ As Trump ]
Took me to Walter Reed.

00:06:54.767 --> 00:06:56.968
They got the best neck guy.

00:06:56.968 --> 00:06:58.501
What a harrowing ride
in the helicopter.

00:06:58.501 --> 00:06:59.701
Same helicopter.

00:06:59.701 --> 00:07:01.901
[ Laughter ]

00:07:01.901 --> 00:07:03.033
And I'm just sitting there.

00:07:03.033 --> 00:07:05.667
The team of doctors
looking at my body,

00:07:05.667 --> 00:07:08.300
another one holding my head
in the crook of his arm.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.834
[ Laughter ]
And I'm watching
the whole thing.

00:07:10.834 --> 00:07:12.634
And I'm thinking,
"Goodbye to that body."

00:07:12.634 --> 00:07:13.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:13.667 --> 00:07:15.267
And, right before I
passed out...

00:07:15.267 --> 00:07:16.801
[ Laughter ]

00:07:16.801 --> 00:07:18.501
...I'll never forget
the last thing I said.

00:07:18.501 --> 00:07:21.868
I said, "Cut the head off Eric's
and give me his body."

00:07:21.868 --> 00:07:24.000
[ Laughter ]

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.234
Regeneron!

00:07:26.234 --> 00:07:29.434
They use Regeneron,
an amazing -- an amazing drug.

00:07:29.434 --> 00:07:30.868
It comes in a pill

00:07:30.868 --> 00:07:32.300
or a glue.

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.467
[ Laughter ]

00:07:33.467 --> 00:07:35.834
They just sort of caulk it
onto your body,

00:07:35.834 --> 00:07:37.534
put the head back on.

00:07:37.534 --> 00:07:38.934
Doctor said to me, "Sir..."

00:07:38.934 --> 00:07:42.734
[ Laughter ]

00:07:42.734 --> 00:07:44.767
"...we couldn't believe that the
blade went through your skin."

00:07:44.767 --> 00:07:46.067
Toughest skin they've ever seen.

00:07:46.067 --> 00:07:47.868
[ Laughter ]
Rich, they said,

00:07:47.868 --> 00:07:49.601
like rich Corinthian leather.

00:07:49.601 --> 00:07:51.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:51.234 --> 00:07:52.701
Ricardo Montalban.

00:07:52.701 --> 00:07:53.868
[ Laughter ]

00:07:53.868 --> 00:07:55.300
Bad guy, mean guy.

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:56.934
[ Laughter ]

00:07:56.934 --> 00:07:58.000
That is --
[ Laughs ]

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:01.434
[ Laughter ]

00:08:01.434 --> 00:08:04.501
That is --

00:08:04.501 --> 00:08:05.501
Nice to me, though.

00:08:05.501 --> 00:08:07.234
You guys,

00:08:07.234 --> 00:08:08.534
of course Trump
is refusing to meet

00:08:08.534 --> 00:08:09.901
with one of his most
loyal defenders,

00:08:09.901 --> 00:08:11.300
now that Gaetz is
in legal trouble.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.701
Haven't these guys
learned anything?

00:08:12.701 --> 00:08:14.667
Trump will never return
the loyalty you show him, ever.

00:08:14.667 --> 00:08:16.367
That's why
he's never had a dog.

00:08:16.367 --> 00:08:18.067
If Trump played fetch
with a golden retriever,

00:08:18.067 --> 00:08:19.634
the first time he brought back
the tennis ball,

00:08:19.634 --> 00:08:21.901
Trump would present the dog
with a bill.

00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:24.234
So Trump's dodging Gaetz,
after Gaetz spent years

00:08:24.234 --> 00:08:26.033
parroting Trump's
most unhinged lies.

00:08:26.033 --> 00:08:27.667
Next thing you know, Trump's
going to start acting like

00:08:27.667 --> 00:08:30.400
he doesn't even know
Matt Gaetz's name.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:32.000
-"It was Trump's fault."
It's always Trump's fault.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:34.834
Can it ever be like
Rick Gaetz's fault?

00:08:34.834 --> 00:08:37.300
[ Laughter ]
I mean --

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:39.100
It's always Trump's fault,
Rick.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:42.601
Every single guy, even if they
hated me, they'd all contribute.

00:08:42.601 --> 00:08:45.901
But, Rick, you understand that I
don't want to make those calls.

00:08:45.901 --> 00:08:47.868
-In fairness, he definitely
looks more like a Rick

00:08:47.868 --> 00:08:49.434
than a Matt,
although I'm guessing Trump

00:08:49.434 --> 00:08:51.534
just calls everyone Rick,
if he forgets their name.

00:08:51.534 --> 00:08:53.234
I mean, he lives in Florida,
so it probably works

00:08:53.234 --> 00:08:54.901
about 60% of the time.

00:08:54.901 --> 00:08:56.200
[ As Trump ]
And, now, I'd like to introduce

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:58.100
the former first lady,
my beautiful wife,

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:00.234
my best friend,
lifelong companion.

00:09:00.234 --> 00:09:02.067
Rick!
[ Laughter ]

00:09:02.067 --> 00:09:03.834
Rick!
Don't be like that.

00:09:03.834 --> 00:09:05.267
[ Laughter ]

00:09:05.267 --> 00:09:06.467
Trump's not the only Republican

00:09:06.467 --> 00:09:07.801
apparently turning
his back on Gaetz.

00:09:07.801 --> 00:09:10.100
Conservatives, in general,
including Gaetz's buddies

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.100
on Fox News, which has...

00:09:14.033 --> 00:09:16.667
...have suddenly gone quiet,
although part of that may be due

00:09:16.667 --> 00:09:18.567
to the fact that,
even though he's on TV

00:09:18.567 --> 00:09:21.300
all the damn time,
nobody seems to like him much.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:25.367
-Another day,
and yet, very little response

00:09:25.367 --> 00:09:27.067
from his fellow Republicans.

00:09:27.067 --> 00:09:28.234
-Right. [ Laughs ]

00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:29.534
Well, it's an open secret

00:09:29.534 --> 00:09:32.000
that he's not well-liked
among Republicans.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.968
-He has no one in Congress --

00:09:33.968 --> 00:09:35.367
Not no one, but almost no one

00:09:35.367 --> 00:09:37.367
who really wants to stand
with him right now.

00:09:37.367 --> 00:09:38.868
He has very few defenders.

00:09:38.868 --> 00:09:39.934
-Gaetz's own aides...

00:09:43.734 --> 00:09:45.000
-[ Laughs ]

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:46.501
-...meaning they didn't
even like the guy.

00:09:46.501 --> 00:09:48.367
-Gaetz was never
particularly popular

00:09:48.367 --> 00:09:50.734
among his House Republican
colleagues.

00:09:50.734 --> 00:09:52.467
-They're probably just jealous
that Matt Gaetz is

00:09:52.467 --> 00:09:54.300
the only elected man
in the Republican Party

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:55.634
who gives a [bleep]
about his clothes.

00:09:55.634 --> 00:09:57.968
I'm not saying I like his style,
but at least he has one.

00:09:57.968 --> 00:10:01.701
The rest of them look like
they buy their suits at...

00:10:01.701 --> 00:10:04.400
"We're going to hate the way
you look, so why bother?"

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:07.534
Does this mean even Jim Jordan
won't come to Gaetz's aid,

00:10:07.534 --> 00:10:09.734
the Donkey to his Shrek?

00:10:09.734 --> 00:10:11.200
I have to say,
it's so funny that Republicans

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:13.334
are suddenly telling reporters
how much they hate Matt Gaetz.

00:10:13.334 --> 00:10:14.868
They sound like a bunch
of mean high schoolers.

00:10:14.868 --> 00:10:17.300
You can just picture Ted Cruz
and Kevin McCarthy

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:19.901
gossiping at their lockers
in the congressional hallway.

00:10:19.901 --> 00:10:21.100
[ As McCarthy ]
Matt invited me to his house

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.200
to do whippits in his basement
and I said no.

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:26.234
[ As Cruz ]
Well, I told Matt I couldn't go
over to this house after school

00:10:26.234 --> 00:10:27.567
to check out his pet lizard

00:10:27.567 --> 00:10:29.901
because I had to comb
the lice out of my beard.

00:10:29.901 --> 00:10:32.267
Now, let's go shake
Lindsey Graham upside down.

00:10:32.267 --> 00:10:34.167
[ As Graham ]
Fellas, I don't have
any lunch money.

00:10:34.167 --> 00:10:37.334
Meemaw packs me a pudding
and some Lunchables every day

00:10:37.334 --> 00:10:39.701
and tells me I don't deserve it
because I interrupt her

00:10:39.701 --> 00:10:41.400
while she's flirting
with the mailman.

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:44.300
He's got other houses
to get to, Meemaw!

00:10:44.300 --> 00:10:45.734
[ Laughter ]

00:10:45.734 --> 00:10:48.234
One of the last friends
Gaetz seemed to have left

00:10:48.234 --> 00:10:49.934
was this guy, Joel Greenberg,

00:10:49.934 --> 00:10:53.567
who's been indicted and faces
33 federal charges

00:10:53.567 --> 00:10:55.667
as part of the investigation
that ensnared Gaetz.

00:10:55.667 --> 00:10:59.434
Greenberg is the former
Seminole County tax collector,

00:10:59.434 --> 00:11:00.868
which is like a job

00:11:00.868 --> 00:11:03.000
out of Small Town Corruption
Mad Libs.

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:06.100
If you're the Seminole County
tax collector

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.701
and you get business cards
printed up,

00:11:07.701 --> 00:11:10.501
they automatically add...

00:11:10.501 --> 00:11:12.033
Of course
this dude was corrupt.

00:11:12.033 --> 00:11:14.067
Look at him.
A lawyer in a labor dispute

00:11:14.067 --> 00:11:16.267
involving a former employee
told The New York Times...

00:11:19.067 --> 00:11:20.968
A statement meant
to be hyperbolic,

00:11:20.968 --> 00:11:22.834
but, when said in the context
of the state of Florida,

00:11:22.834 --> 00:11:24.901
seemed like a thing that
might've already happened.

00:11:24.901 --> 00:11:26.734
I made an intern rewatch
that Tiger man thing

00:11:26.734 --> 00:11:28.267
and, no, he was never
a tax collector,

00:11:28.267 --> 00:11:30.801
but he did run for governor
and he did do pretty well.

00:11:30.801 --> 00:11:33.167
And, by the way, even if he was
the actual Tiger King,

00:11:33.167 --> 00:11:35.901
it would still probably
lead them back to Matt Gaetz.

00:11:35.901 --> 00:11:38.367
[ As Gaetz ]
Yes, I Venmo'd Carole Baskin!

00:11:38.367 --> 00:11:40.767
With the subject line "Husband"
and a shovel emoji.

00:11:40.767 --> 00:11:42.501
So what?
That could mean anything.

00:11:42.501 --> 00:11:44.234
And, if you give me three days,
I promise to come up

00:11:44.234 --> 00:11:47.334
with at least one other
possible explanation.

00:11:47.334 --> 00:11:49.200
Greenberg's been accused
of an impressively long

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:51.734
and diverse litany of crimes
and other inappropriate conduct.

00:11:51.734 --> 00:11:52.801
According to The Times, he...

00:12:10.234 --> 00:12:12.667
Okay, first of all,
I got my groomsmen tie clips

00:12:12.667 --> 00:12:14.167
that were engraved
with the words "Thank you."

00:12:14.167 --> 00:12:16.167
So, if you feel the need
to get your groomsmen

00:12:16.167 --> 00:12:18.267
no-show jobs, I mean,
you're hushing them up

00:12:18.267 --> 00:12:20.601
after someone drowned
on a fishing trip, right?

00:12:20.601 --> 00:12:22.567
Also, he had fake IDs
in his backpack?

00:12:22.567 --> 00:12:24.000
Is he a county tax collector

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:25.667
or the coolest kid
in the eighth grade?

00:12:25.667 --> 00:12:27.100
Where did they arrest him,
outside a liquor store,

00:12:27.100 --> 00:12:28.534
buying beer for teenagers?

00:12:28.534 --> 00:12:31.567
But, apparently, Greenberg
wasn't Gaetz's only wingman.

00:12:31.567 --> 00:12:34.067
He was also close
with yet another

00:12:34.067 --> 00:12:36.334
impossibly Floridian character,

00:12:36.334 --> 00:12:39.367
who's now been implicated
in the investigation as well.

00:12:39.367 --> 00:12:41.267
-CBS News has learned
that investigators

00:12:41.267 --> 00:12:43.634
are scrutinizing a trip
Congressman Matt Gaetz took

00:12:43.634 --> 00:12:46.400
to the Bahamas with this man,
Jason Pirozzolo,

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:47.934
a marijuana entrepreneur,

00:12:47.934 --> 00:12:49.133
Orlando hand surgeon,

00:12:49.133 --> 00:12:50.734
and donor to Gaetz.

00:12:50.734 --> 00:12:52.267
-My name is Dr. Jason Pirozzolo,

00:12:52.267 --> 00:12:54.400
with Orlando Hand Surgery
Associates.

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:56.634
-Multiple sources familiar
with the federal probe

00:12:56.634 --> 00:12:58.901
tells CBS News Pirozzolo
and Gaetz traveled

00:12:58.901 --> 00:13:02.067
to the Bahamas in late 2013
or early 2019

00:13:02.067 --> 00:13:03.267
and Pirozzolo...

00:13:07.434 --> 00:13:09.267
One key question
for investigators --

00:13:09.267 --> 00:13:10.934
were the women
illegally trafficked

00:13:10.934 --> 00:13:13.000
across state
or international lines

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:15.968
for the purposes of sex
with the congressman?

00:13:15.968 --> 00:13:17.734
-That's right,
Gaetz went to the Bahamas

00:13:17.734 --> 00:13:19.234
with an Orlando hand surgeon

00:13:19.234 --> 00:13:20.868
who's also a marijuana
entrepreneur.

00:13:20.868 --> 00:13:22.300
The only way that could be

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:24.501
a more perfectly
Floridian occupation is

00:13:24.501 --> 00:13:26.367
if he added owner and operator

00:13:26.367 --> 00:13:29.834
of fan boat traveling
funeral parlor for kids.

00:13:29.834 --> 00:13:31.601
Also, I'm just curious.
When you're in medical school,

00:13:31.601 --> 00:13:33.634
choosing a specialty,
how do you land on hands?

00:13:33.634 --> 00:13:35.534
Was he high when they asked him?

00:13:35.534 --> 00:13:37.033
"So, Doctor,
what do you want to focus on?"

00:13:37.033 --> 00:13:43.567
-Krrkkhh!

00:13:43.567 --> 00:13:44.634
[ Laughter ]

00:13:44.634 --> 00:13:47.934
Krrkkhh!

00:13:47.934 --> 00:13:50.834
[ Stoner voice ]
I've always liked looking
at my hands.

00:13:50.834 --> 00:13:52.167
Or necks?

00:13:52.167 --> 00:13:53.567
[ Laughter ]

00:13:53.567 --> 00:13:55.400
Matt Gaetz was supposed
to be one of the leaders

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:57.334
of the next generation
of Trumpism in the GOP.

00:13:57.334 --> 00:14:00.534
Now, he's isolated, embattled,
and under federal investigation,

00:14:00.534 --> 00:14:02.467
like so many other members
of Trump's inner circle,

00:14:02.467 --> 00:14:03.767
including, of course,
Trump himself.

00:14:03.767 --> 00:14:06.467
It's emblematic of the state
of the modern GOP.

00:14:06.467 --> 00:14:09.167
Gaetz has denied all the
allegations, but who knows?

00:14:09.167 --> 00:14:10.767
If the feds continue
to close in on him,

00:14:10.767 --> 00:14:12.801
maybe I'll finally
make good on his promise.

00:14:12.801 --> 00:14:14.734
-I would leave my House seat.

00:14:14.734 --> 00:14:16.100
I would leave my home.

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:17.601
-This has been
"A Closer Look."

